## 🌟 Conclusion

Gaming Arena is a multi-game application that demonstrates the practical use of Data Structures and Algorithms through interactive gameplay.

The project helps students understand programming concepts, improve problem-solving abilities, and gain experience in modular development and team collaboration.

It combines learning and entertainment into a single platform while showcasing the capabilities of the C programming language.

